 "notes": "All six old kinds kept. Old Edison cylinder models (Amberol, Blue Amberol, Gold Moulded) and flexi models (Soundsheet, Sonosheet) became archetypes. Old sources replaced by retrieved Wikipedia pages where better. Left out: Presto discs as an archetype (only the Presto 'K' recorder and 8N engraver were attested, not a disc line), HMV as a separate entry (no retrieved page tied it to a disc line; The Gramophone Company covers it), Pathé Actuelle as an archetype (a lateral 78 label; named only as a line). Recordio launch year left as 1940–1950 (museum record) since the 1939 date came only from a search snippet."
